OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused men face trial over
OL,4,Awoman's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men accused of murder after a
OL,7,Fwoman's body was found in a
OL,8,FLincolnshire village have appeared in
OL,9,Fcourt.
OL,11,FHayley Marson, 33, was found dead at a
OL,12,Fproperty on Thames Street, in
OL,13,FHogsthorpe, near Skegness, at about
OL,14,F09:00 BST on 30 September, Lincolnshire
OL,15,FPolice said.
OL,17,FJohn Scott, 52, of no fixed address,
OL,18,Fand John Welby, 65, of Thames Street,
OL,19,FHogsthorpe, were both charged with her
OL,20,Fmurder.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
