OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused men face trial over
OL,4,Awoman's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth men appeared at Lincoln Crown
OL,7,FCourt, where the case was adjourned
OL,8,Funtil 18 December for a plea and trial
OL,9,Fpreparation hearing. A provisional
OL,10,Ftrial date was also set for 22 March
OL,11,Fnext year, with the trial expected to
OL,12,Flast two to three weeks.
